# Copy to .env (gitignored). Never commit a real token.
# Cloudflare → My Profile → API Tokens → Create Token (Custom)
#
# Suggested permissions (least privilege):
#   Account → Account Settings → Read          (optional; for account listing)
#   Zone → Zone → Read
#   Zone → Zone Settings → Edit
#   Zone → Cache Purge → Purge
#   Zone → DNS → Edit                          (only if you use proxy-apex)
# Zone Resources: All zones from an account, or a specific subset.
#
# Do not reuse a token that is scoped to a single production zone
# if you intend to manage a whole fleet.

CF_API_TOKEN=cfut_REPLACE_ME

# Optional: restrict all commands to one account id
# CF_ACCOUNT_ID=
